 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Of course. A blanket, a few warm hats, a small flashlight, a small stock of snacks, and a small toy or two. Then a small sketchbook and some pens would be lovely as her gift to herself. Masking tape. Wrap it layer by layer as you go through it, so it lasts as long as winter. Also, a warm jacket with a lining that doesn't stab her. A light and some snacks go together in the emergency box. And a toy or two so she can have something special at home when she feels like it.",
